OL,5,
OL,6,FA boy whose family fought for cannabis
OL,7,Foil to prevent his epileptic seizures
OL,8,Fface supplies running out after the
OL,9,Ffirm that makes the drug was declared
OL,10,Fbankrupt.
OL,12,FIt comes after Alfie Deacon's mother
OL,13,FHannah took a fight to Downing Street
OL,14,Fin 2018 to win the right for him to get
OL,15,Fthe medication prescribed on the NHS.
OL,16,FHowever, after she died suddenly in
OL,17,F2024, her mother Maggie has taken on
OL,18,FAlfie's case.
